<title>USA: NYSE says Greenbrier mum on market activity.</title>
<headline>NYSE says Greenbrier mum on market activity.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Greenbriar Cos Inc has declined to comment on recent market activity.</p>
<p>The Exchange said it asked the company to make a public statement on whether there are any corporate developments to explain unusual market activity.</p>
<p>The Exchange said the company said its policy is not to comment on unusual activity or rumors.</p>
<p>Greenbriar shares were off 3/4 Tuesday morning at 8-3/4.</p>
